  "body": [
    "Home",
    "AI mythbusting",
    "Subscribe to separate fact from fiction",
    "AI is transforming industries, powering innovation and changing the way we think about the world. But with all the buzz, it’s easy to get caught up in misconceptions that hold enterprises back.",
    "Our data and AI experts are tackling the biggest myths about AI head-on.",
    "Will AI replace our jobs? Do you need clean data to get started with AI? There’s more to it than meets the eye. From creativity to ethics, we’re unpacking the facts and sharing real-world examples to show what AI can — and can’t — do.",
    "Sign up to our email series to join us on this myth-busting journey. Explore the facts, consider the evidence and start unlocking AI’s true potential.",
    "Subscribe",
    "By automating repetitive processes and enabling faster, data-driven decision-making, AI frees us to focus on creative, strategic and high-value work. Mark Ardito, CTO, Americas",
    "By automating repetitive processes and enabling faster, data-driven decision-making, AI frees us to focus on creative, strategic and high-value work.",
    "Mark Ardito, CTO, Americas",
    "Creativity is uniquely human. Try as we might, we can’t distill it into an app, or etch it into code, but we can create systems which spark imagination. Richard Bownes, Lead Data Architect",
    "Creativity is uniquely human. Try as we might, we can’t distill it into an app, or etch it into code, but we can create systems which spark imagination.",
    "Richard Bownes, Lead Data Architect",
    "In an ideal world, every dataset is neatly productized and ready to power any GenAI use case…in reality, most of the unstructured data you need might not yet exist in a polished format. Karl Hampson, CTO, Data & AI",
    "In an ideal world, every dataset is neatly productized and ready to power any GenAI use case…in reality, most of the unstructured data you need might not yet exist in a polished format.",
    "Karl Hampson, CTO, Data & AI",
    "Don’t let misconceptions hold you back. Subscribe now to gain exclusive insights from Valtech’s experts and uncover the real potential of AI in 2025."
